   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener><dateline><date when="1940-01-08">January 8, 1940</date>
               <lb/> <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr.
                 Paul Tillich</rs>
            <lb/>Union Theological Seminary
            <lb/>Broadway and 120th St.
            <lb/><rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York, N. Y.</rs></dateline>
               <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Professor
                  Tillich</rs>:</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>Would you have time to come around and see me some time in my office, perhaps on
               Thursday of this week? I want very much to talk over with you conditions in the
               Deutsch-amerikanischer Kulturverband.</p>
            <p>I am sorry I cannot go to call on you, but I am very much hampered by my inability to
               walk any distance.</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>With kindest regards,<lb/>
               Yours very sincerely,</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__235" type="person"
                  >Franz Boas</rs></signed><lb/>
               fb-e
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
